    {
      "text": "你提供的矩阵状态是原始整数 UMI 计数，符合 scVI 对原始计数输入的要求。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:matrix_state"]
    },
    {
      "text": "scVI 在建模时会以每个细胞的批次注释为条件，因此 donor 可作为批次键传入。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 5,
          "quote": "The distribution is conditioned on the batch annotation bn of each cell (if available), as well as two additional, unobserved random variables."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的批次键是 donor，且标记为 complete，可作为批次注释使用。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": ["user:batch_key"]
    },
    {
      "text": "原始 scVI 模型明确支持批次整合和降维，但未声称相对其他方法具有比较优势。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "quote": "focusing on batch removal and normalization, dimensionality reduction and clustering, and differential expression."
        }
      ],
